speechtext:
I have the details of the population of South Bruce here as the Bill proposes to leave that riding, and they are

as follows :	Elderslie, population 2,458 ;
Chesley, 1,734 ; Paisley, 1,086 ; Brant, 4,349; Oarrick, 5,023 ; Cullross, 2,955 ; Grennock, 3,085 ; Walkerton, 2,971 ; Teeswater, 930 ; Huron, 3,539 ; Kinloss, 2,355 ; Lucknow, 1,111, making a total of 31,596 under tlie proposition of the government as contained in this Bill. Now, under my proposition the population of South Bruce would be, as I have said 31,250, making the difference between the population of the two ridings 346 less than the difference contained in the proposition in the Bill.
